/* ── region card ──────────────────────────────────────────────────────── */
/* The sandbox card carried a site count and a latency figure per region. The
   platform records neither, so rather than print invented numbers the card shows
   what is true: where it is, and which continent it sits on.
   `ms` used to render here as "~X ms" with a signal-strength bar graphic —
